```Title: Logon with New Credentials (LogonType 9, seclogo) (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1134.003 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 1f00f1b5-1070-45d2-ad88-e92eadf697ab```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4624 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Administrators using runas /netonly```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode=4624 LogonType=9 LogonProcessName="*seclogo*")
| table _time host TargetUserName TargetDomainName LogonType IpAddress WorkstationName
